---
title: Side Neck Stretch
type: docs
prev: docs/rastyazhka/
---
![растяжка боковой поверхности шеи](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8946054-b059-4820-8947-131255f34930)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Stand up straight. Reach your right arm over your head and place your right hand gently on the left side of your head.

### Step 2
Slowly tilt your head toward your right shoulder, applying very light, gentle pressure with your hand to increase the stretch along the side of your neck.

### Step 3
Hold this position for 15–20 seconds, then slowly and gently return to the center.

### Step 4
Complete the desired number of reps, then repeat the stretch on the other side.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Never force the movement—stop well before feeling any sharp pain.

• Keep your shoulders down and try to relax your neck muscles as much as possible.

• Breathe naturally and do not hold your breath.
{{< /callout >}}
